<view class="page"><view class="title">我的设置</view><view class="muted">{{user.nickname}} · 体验版</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><view class="card"><view class="section">卡通图片模型</view><view class="muted">使用你自己的 API Key，模型调用可能产生费用。留空 Key 保留已存密钥；服务商切换时请填写对应新 Key。</view><picker range="{{['OpenAI 兼容','Gemini']}}" value="{{image.provider==='gemini'?1:0}}" data-group="image" bindchange="provider"><view class="field">{{image.provider}} ▾</view></picker><input class="field"  value="{{image.baseUrl}}" placeholder="接口 Base URL" data-group="image" data-key="baseUrl" bindinput="field" disabled="{{busy}}"/><input class="field"  value="{{image.model}}" placeholder="模型名称" data-group="image" data-key="model" bindinput="field" disabled="{{busy}}"/><input class="field" password value="{{image.apiKey}}" placeholder="API Key（已保存后不回显）" data-group="image" data-key="apiKey" bindinput="field" disabled="{{busy}}"/><view class="muted">{{image.hasKey?"已保存密钥":"尚未保存密钥"}}</view><button data-group="image" bindtap="save" disabled="{{busy}}">保存配置</button><button class="secondary" data-group="image" bindtap="clear" disabled="{{busy}}">移除配置与密钥</button></view><view class="card"><view class="section">识别与搭配模型</view><view class="muted">使用你自己的 API Key，模型调用可能产生费用。留空 Key 保留已存密钥；服务商切换时请填写对应新 Key。</view><picker range="{{['OpenAI 兼容','Gemini']}}" value="{{llm.provider==='gemini'?1:0}}" data-group="llm" bindchange="provider"><view class="field">{{llm.provider}} ▾</view></picker><input class="field"  value="{{llm.baseUrl}}" placeholder="接口 Base URL" data-group="llm" data-key="baseUrl" bindinput="field" disabled="{{busy}}"/><input class="field"  value="{{llm.model}}" placeholder="模型名称" data-group="llm" data-key="model" bindinput="field" disabled="{{busy}}"/><input class="field" password value="{{llm.apiKey}}" placeholder="API Key（已保存后不回显）" data-group="llm" data-key="apiKey" bindinput="field" disabled="{{busy}}"/><view class="muted">{{llm.hasKey?"已保存密钥":"尚未保存密钥"}}</view><button data-group="llm" bindtap="save" disabled="{{busy}}">保存配置</button><button class="secondary" data-group="llm" bindtap="clear" disabled="{{busy}}">移除配置与密钥</button></view><view class="muted">照片与身材信息仅用于衣柜和搭配；需要删除试用账号及数据请联系邀请人。当前不提供自动身材扫描。</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="logout" disabled="{{busy}}">退出登录</button></view>